<https://katkatkateryna.github.io/ospd2026_bblocks-template/> a skos:ConceptScheme,
        dcat:Catalog,
        bblocks:BBlocksRegister ;
    rdfs:label "Building Blocks - RSS-Hydro Model of Models Building Blocks" ;
    dct:abstract """Provenance building blocks for the RSS-Hydro Model of Models (MoM) flood prediction workflow,
profiled for the OGC Open Science Persistent Demonstrator (OSPD) 2026.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
    dct:description """W3C PROV profile and activity vocabulary for a minimal slice of the MoM workflow:
GFMS per-watershed cell attribution, GFMS per-watershed aggregation, and GloFAS + GFMS
hazard score accumulation.
"""^^<https://www.w3.org/ns/iana/media-types/text/markdown> ;
